e whether the resulting statement is true.\n\n- Substituting the point $A(-2,8)$ results in a false statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-3x \\\\ (8) & =-3(-2)+0 \\\\ 8 & =6\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point $A$ does *not* lie on the line.\n\n- Substituting the point $B(0,-2)$ results in a false statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-3x \\\\ (-2) & =-3(0)+0 \\\\ -2 & =0\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point $B$ does not lie on the line.\n\n- Substituting the point $C(2,-6)$ results in a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-3x \\\\ (-6) & =-3(2)+0 \\\\ -6 & =-6\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point $C$ does lie on the line.\n\nFinally, only point $C$ lies on the line." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["84d72100-1cce-5a74-8205-dd9bc89e56ac"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "2d413d8c-3f61-5d64-83db-8f504335c5bb" :answer/id #uuid "2d413d8c-3f61-5d64-83db-8f504335c5bb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $B$ only" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3c85b355-307a-57db-947f-d3ef8d268d84" :answer/id #uuid "3c85b355-307a-57db-947f-d3ef8d268d84" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "83323bd5-5d34-562b-8783-b053fe0eef22" :answer/id #uuid "83323bd5-5d34-562b-8783-b053fe0eef22" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ only" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "da7c1cda-1a6a-51a1-bee2-23c37eac0b62" :answer/id #uuid "da7c1cda-1a6a-51a1-bee2-23c37eac0b62" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$B$ only" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a8f856d5-e5e8-54b8-ab43-051a8533362c" :answer/id #uuid "a8f856d5-e5e8-54b8-ab43-051a8533362c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$C$ only" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "50fbda0d-f2a0-59f8-8288-e3b71a72d78f" :answer-field/id #uuid "50fbda0d-f2a0-59f8-8288-e3b71a72d78f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-f